   "szLabel": "Phase141Description",
   "szText": "I found Lorath just where Tharra said he'd be and barely in time to save him from the Drowned. He fought like a man with nothing to lose. What could he be thinking?",
   "hLabel": 530342571
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
